        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Squarepinski </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Minimalist Puzzle with Maximum Charm</i><br> <br><strong>Squarepinski</strong> is a cosy but challenging puzzle game that reinvents the classic jigsaw. In this geometric challenge, every piece is the humble square; but don’t be fooled by their lack of tabs! Instead of relying on borders or corners, you'll be figuring out how big each piece needs to be, and which have been mirrored! It's jigsaw puzzling... but not as you know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras/4356c93304f354de21461be2c91ed665.avif?t=1764534184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras_big/4356c93304f354de21461be2c91ed665.avif?t=1764534184 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Whimsy</strong> <br>Enjoy original, hand-drawn artwork, specifically designed for this unique puzzle format. Solve  charming scenes of animals doing delightfully human things, like badgers serving beers or cows playing poker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras/a4dc19d9822b449dae390ee687100871.avif?t=1764534184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras_big/a4dc19d9822b449dae390ee687100871.avif?t=1764534184 width=800 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax and Unwind</strong> <br>With soft sounds and a cosy, relaxed vibe, <strong>Squarepinski</strong> offers a peaceful space to unwind and engage your brain at your own pace. No timer. No Pressure. Just you, a charming puzzle, and a warm cup of whimsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What do I get?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique puzzle packs (with more to come as DLC in the future)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic: The original line up from the 2024 Game Makers Toolkit Gamejam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maru &amp; Mochi: Adorable cats belonging to our devoloper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni: A Shepsky belonging to our Artist &amp; Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmonia Village: More scenes of critters in the style of the original game art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractals: A challenging series of beautiful (and mathematical!) fractals edited by our artist for maximum aesthetic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited custom image uploads!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hidden secrets...</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Squarepinski </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Minimalist Puzzle with Maximum Charm</i><br> <br><strong>Squarepinski</strong> is a cosy but challenging puzzle game that reinvents the classic jigsaw. In this geometric challenge, every piece is the humble square; but don’t be fooled by their lack of tabs! Instead of relying on borders or corners, you'll be figuring out how big each piece needs to be, and which have been mirrored! It's jigsaw puzzling... but not as you know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras/4356c93304f354de21461be2c91ed665.avif?t=1764534184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras_big/4356c93304f354de21461be2c91ed665.avif?t=1764534184 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Whimsy</strong> <br>Enjoy original, hand-drawn artwork, specifically designed for this unique puzzle format. Solve  charming scenes of animals doing delightfully human things, like badgers serving beers or cows playing poker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras/a4dc19d9822b449dae390ee687100871.avif?t=1764534184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600120/extras_big/a4dc19d9822b449dae390ee687100871.avif?t=1764534184 width=800 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax and Unwind</strong> <br>With soft sounds and a cosy, relaxed vibe, <strong>Squarepinski</strong> offers a peaceful space to unwind and engage your brain at your own pace. No timer. No Pressure. Just you, a charming puzzle, and a warm cup of whimsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What do I get?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique puzzle packs (with more to come as DLC in the future)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic: The original line up from the 2024 Game Makers Toolkit Gamejam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maru &amp; Mochi: Adorable cats belonging to our devoloper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni: A Shepsky belonging to our Artist &amp; Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmonia Village: More scenes of critters in the style of the original game art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractals: A challenging series of beautiful (and mathematical!) fractals edited by our artist for maximum aesthetic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited custom image uploads!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hidden secrets...</p></li></ul>",
